# Root Docker build context, shared by every image built with `context: .` in
# docker-compose*.yml: feed-engine (Go) and each Rust brain that depends on the
# shared `libs/manhattan-client` crate by path. A path dependency cannot be
# reached from a per-brain context, so those brains build from the root and
# their Dockerfiles COPY `<brain>/…` and `libs/…`.
#
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, re-include only the trees an image
# builds from, then drop their local build artefacts so the context stays small
# and hermetic.

# Ignore everything by default.
*

# Shared Rust crates.
!libs

# Go services.
!feed-engine
!gnosis-malkuth

# Rust brains that depend on libs/ and therefore build from the repo root.
!aethyr-ledger
!alexandria
!herald
!themis
!verity
!zodacare
!ain-soph
!astraon
!lore
!registry-brain
!elohim-veni
!frequencies

# Drop local build output / noise inside the included trees.
**/target
feed-engine/feed-engine
feed-engine/web/static/uploads/
feed-engine/.idea/
gnosis-malkuth/target/
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.log
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/node_modules
